<title>USA: Miles Homes Inc Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Miles Homes Inc Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHESHIRE, Conn. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.19     loss	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,000     loss	 1,400</p>
<p> Revs			29,200		   18,400</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.02     loss	 $0.99</p>
<p> Net profit		   200     loss	10,700</p>
<p> Revs			67,100		   48,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 includes a charge of $100,000 from discontinued operations at Patwil Homes.</p>
<p>1995 Q3 includes a gain of $900,000 related to the retirement of debt and a loss of $1.6 million from the operations of Patwil Homes.</p>
